# Key Idea
Assign most frequent characters to lowest cost positions using greedy strategy.

# Complexity
- Time complexity: $$O(n*logn)$$

- Space complexity: $$O(1)$$

# Code
```java []
class Solution {
    public int minimumPushes(String word) {
        int[] freq = new int[26];
        int result = 0;

        for (char ch : word.toCharArray()) {
            freq[ch - 'a']++;
        }

        Arrays.sort(freq);
        int n = freq.length;

        // Sorting in descending order
        for (int i = 0; i < n / 2; i++) {
            int temp = freq[i];
            freq[i] = freq[n - 1 - i];
            freq[n - 1 - i] = temp;
        }

        for (int i = 0; i < 26; i++) {
            int press = i / 8 + 1;
            result += (freq[i] * press); // freq * how many times we have to press for the button to write it single time
        }

        return result;
    }
}
```
